":24,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/3/name_i18n/cn","英雄专精"],["/skills/3/name_i18n/jp","天賦の才"],["/skills/3/simple_description_i18n/cn","提高自身暴击。"],["/skills/3/simple_description_i18n/jp","自身のクリティカルUP"],["/skills/3/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，自身的暴击提升24点。"],["/skills/3/variants/0/description_i18n/jp","戦闘中、自身のクリティカル+24"],["/skills/3/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，自身的暴击提升32点。"],["/skills/3/variants/1/description_i18n/jp","戦闘中、自身のクリティカル+32"],["/skills/3/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，自身的暴击提升40点。"],["/skills/3/variants/2/description_i18n/jp","戦闘中、自身のクリティカル+40"],["/skills/4/name_i18n/cn","秘光之盾"],["/skills/4/name_i18n/jp","アビサルシールド"],["/skills/4/simple_description_i18n/cn","战斗开始时，获得一个护盾。"],["/skills/4/simple_description_i18n/jp","戦闘開始時にシールドを獲得"],["/skills/4/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","“先发制人”释放后，自身获得一个抵御450% ATK伤害的护盾。"],["/skills/4/variants/0/description_i18n/jp","「イニシアチブ」使用後、450% ATK分のダメージを防ぐシールドを獲得"],["/skills/4/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":18,"end":26,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/4/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":12,"end":20,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/4/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","护盾的抵御值提升至500% ATK。"],["/skills/4/variants/1/description_i18n/jp","シールド値が500% ATKにUP"],["/skills/4/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":17,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/4/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":6,"end":14,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/4/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","“疾影旋击”持续期间，若标记的敌人被击败，该敌人附近2格范围内的敌人受到4秒恐惧效果。"],["/skills/4/variants/2/description_i18n/jp","「影の旋撃」の持続期間中、マークされた敵が撃破された場合、その敵の周囲2マス範囲内の敵は4秒間、「恐怖」状態になる"],["/skills/4/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","护盾的抵御值提升至600% ATK。"],["/skills/4/variants/3/description_i18n/jp","シールド値が600% ATKにUP"],["/skills/4/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":17,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/4/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":6,"end":14,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/5/name_i18n/cn","觉醒之力"],["/skills/5/name_i18n/jp","覚醒の力"],["/skills/5/simple_description_i18n/cn","每次回旋击还能降低目标受愈。"],["/skills/5/simple_description_i18n/jp","旋回攻撃のたびに、対象の治癒DOWN"],["/skills/5/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","每次回旋击还能在3秒内降低目标60点受愈。"],["/skills/5/variants/0/description_i18n/jp","旋回攻撃を行うたびに、3秒間、対象の治癒-60"],["/skills/5/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","技能“先发制人”造成的伤害额外提升250% ATK，释放“疾影旋击”期间，获得50点攻击速度。对“先发制人”目标的普攻还会附带其已损生命值12%的伤害，额外伤害部分不超过240% ATK。若和伊莎贝拉一同上阵，自身获得“秘光之盾”时，还会为伊莎贝拉提供等量护盾。"],["/skills/5/variants/1/description_i18n/jp","スキル「イニシアチブ」によるダメージ+250% ATK。「影の旋撃」の発動中、自身の攻撃速度+50。「イニシアチブ」の対象に通常攻撃を行う時、追加で対象のHP減少量×12%のダメージを与える。この追加ダメージは240% ATKを超えない。味方のイザベラが出撃中の場合、自身に「アビサルシールド」が付与された時、イザベラにも同量のシールド値を付与"],["/skills/5/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":17,"end":25,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":85,"end":93,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/5/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":19,"end":27,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":105,"end":113,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/exclusive_equipment/name_i18n/cn","恶毒双刃"],["/exclusive_equipment/name_i18n/jp","邪悪な双刃"]]}